  "description": "“Your ex-boyfriend showed up as a new employee.”\n“It’d be nice if you could treat me as kindly as you used to.”\n\nDanbi Lee, a 7th-year office worker who’s barely getting through life,\nand Han Yeo-reum, her ex-boyfriend who keeps shaking her up again.\n\nWhy did Han Yeo-reum come back?\nWill that summer — the passionate one we once had — return to us again?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=839539), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12662763)\n\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/summer-my-love/list?title_no=8764), [Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/summer-my-love/list?title_no=8628), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/summer-my-love/list?title_no=8745), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004360)",
